# Card osLDRRqj (org census 8VXvUrQ5): `google-github-actions/auth` writes
# gha-creds-<hash>.json into the workspace, and every `gcloud run deploy --source .` /
# `gcloud builds submit .` in .github/workflows (deploy.yml, deploy-realapp.yml, preview.yml)
# uploads the workspace root after it. This repo had no .gcloudignore, so gcloud fell back to
# its generated default, which includes the file.
#
# `#!include:.gitignore` keeps today's exclusions exactly as they are (node_modules/, .env,
# *.log, ...); the one added line is the credentials file. create_credentials_file: false is NOT
# an option here: the later gcloud steps read that very file for auth.
#!include:.gitignore
gha-creds-*.json
